    {
        "Path":  "E:\\THE Hive New\\Cynox-main\\Cynox-main\\frontend\\app\\bower_components\\moment\\CHANGELOG.md",
        "LineNumber":  571,
        "Line":  "    * [#1761](https://github.com/moment/moment/issues/1761): moments created without a language are no longer following the global language, in case it changes. Only newly created moments take the global language by default. In case you\u0027re affected by this, wait, comment on [#1797](https://github.com/moment/moment/issues/1797) and wait for a proper reimplementation"
    },
    {
        "Path":  "E:\\THE Hive New\\Cynox-main\\Cynox-main\\frontend\\app\\bower_components\\moment\\CHANGELOG.md",
        "LineNumber":  572,
        "Line":  "    * [#1642](https://github.com/moment/moment/issues/1642): 45 days is no longer \"a month\" according to humanize, cutoffs for month, and year have changed. Hopefully your code does not depend on a particular answer from humanize (which it shouldn\u0027t anyway)"
    },
    {
        "Path":  "E:\\THE Hive New\\Cynox-main\\Cynox-main\\frontend\\app\\bower_components\\moment\\CHANGELOG.md",
        "LineNumber":  573,
        "Line":  "    * [#1784](https://github.com/moment/moment/issues/1784): if you use the human readable English datetime format in a weird way (like storing them in a database) that would break when the format changes you\u0027re at risk."
    },
    {
        "Path":  "E:\\THE Hive New\\Cynox-main\\Cynox-main\\frontend\\app\\bower_components\\moment\\CHANGELOG.md",
        "LineNumber":  576,
        "Line":  "    * [#1761](https://github.com/moment/moment/issues/1761) `lang` is renamed to `locale`, `langData` -\u003e `localeData`. Also there is now `defineLocale` that should be used when creating new locales"
    },
    {
        "Path":  "E:\\THE Hive New\\Cynox-main\\Cynox-main\\frontend\\app\\bower_components\\moment\\CHANGELOG.md",
        "LineNumber":  577,
        "Line":  "    * [#1763](https://github.com/moment/moment/issues/1763) `add(unit, value)` and `subtract(unit, value)` are now deprecated. Use `add(value, unit)` and `subtract(value, unit)` instead."
    },
    {
        "Path":  "E:\\THE Hive New\\Cynox-main\\Cynox-main\\frontend\\app\\bower_components\\moment\\CHANGELOG.md",
        "LineNumber":  578,
        "Line":  "    * [#1759](https://github.com/moment/moment/issues/1759) rename `duration.toIsoString` to `duration.toISOString`. The js standard library and moment\u0027s `toISOString` follow that convention."
    },
    {
